# Roadside Blowout: "This spell costs {2} less to cast if it targets a permanent with mana value 1." Bot2's Smuggler's
# Copter has mana value 2, so the cast costs the full {2}{U}: with {U}{U}{R} in the pool it is paid and the pool is empty
# after. An uncrewed Vehicle is a legal target (CR 205.3g); the Copter returns to Bot2's hand and Bot1 draws a card. Bot1's
# own Ornithopter is a creature an opponent does not control, so it is refused as a target.

